  "2026-09-02T17:56:09.033Z","harness:codex","Investigation note: final exact-head review produced two valid follow-ups and one invalid bounded-projection claim. Accepting the need to qualify indexed versus lock-conflict fallback transaction guarantees in docs and to ensure context-evaluation touch writes survive feedback-recording failures. Rejecting the claim that failed coverage evidence was erased: the 20-entry projection still contains multiple failed coverage runs and immutable history retains test-local-mtjpcko8-cpm11a."
  "2026-09-02T17:59:15.774Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: context evaluation now captures serving/delivery failures, always attempts the later authoritative touch write, rethrows the feedback or touch failure, and preserves both with AggregateError when both writes fail. Direct negative controls cover serving failure, delivery failure, touch-only failure, combined failure, and call order; the focused six-test script suite, TypeScript compilation, and focused ESLint pass. Context relevance documentation now limits atomic projection guarantees to indexed appends and explicitly requires validation or rebuild after lock-conflict fallback append."
  "2026-09-02T18:05:54.455Z","harness:codex","Canonical post-review coverage receipt: pm-linked run test-local-mtkepb3p-avwxjo passed node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage against implementation commit 54c59ac9778dfe2e66651c18fc1ea73790776fd3. The complete 8,306-test suite remained exact at 61,258/61,258 statements, 46,281/46,281 branches, 12,742/12,742 functions, and 58,959/58,959 lines."
