  "2026-09-02T19:11:19.625Z","harness:codex","Verification note: post-1e099373f full coverage run failed only because surface-replication-gate.spec.ts exhausted its 120-second budget under monolithic-suite contention; all other product and integration tests, including the new packed-set assertion, passed. Isolating the full replication suite before rerunning the canonical repository gate; the failed receipt remains immutable evidence."
  "2026-09-02T19:11:58.509Z","harness:codex","Isolation evidence: the complete surface replication file passed 18/18 in 24.42 seconds immediately after the contended full-suite timeout, confirming no deterministic replication regression. Rerunning the canonical PM-linked coverage gate for a terminal receipt."
  "2026-09-02T19:18:45.697Z","harness:codex","Escalated verification finding: a second canonical coverage run reproduced the same 120-second DatabaseSync replication-test timeout despite the complete file passing alone in 23.72 seconds. Treating this as a gate-efficiency defect rather than polling or retrying again; optimizing the test's repository scan while preserving its full trigger and negative-control contract."
  "2026-09-02T19:20:16.438Z","harness:codex","Gate-efficiency implementation: the DatabaseSync trigger test now reuses the production declaration but validates it against a two-member temporary fixture, avoiding five unrelated full-repository AST, ratchet, and refusal scans. It still asserts the complete production trigger vocabulary plus unrelated, loader-body, resolver, assignment, and return-path activation behavior. Combined replication and egress suites passed 21/21 in 12.77 seconds; TypeScript and ESLint passed."
