  "2026-09-02T19:33:54.104Z","harness:codex","Terminal static investigation: CI=1 PM_NON_INTERACTIVE=1 pnpm quality:static reached agent-task-token-gate and failed because the paired replay's application payload differed only at replace:/activity/0/ts. The preceding lint, zero-clone, build/contracts, repository assurance, SDK/package parity, surface replication, grammar, flag, and refusal gates passed. Investigating the replay clock boundary under the existing delivery owner before changing it."
